#. Tag: title
#: using-mainwindow.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding a Photograph to an Album"
msgstr "Engadir unha fotografía a un álbum"

#. Tag: para
#: using-mainwindow.docbook:315
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Most of the time you will create new Albums and populate them with "
#| "photographs directly from your camera using the Camera Tool. However, "
#| "sometimes you may want to add a photograph that you already have on your "
#| "computer to an existing Album. To add a photograph to an Album, make sure "
#| "that the Album is selected. Then, either click the <guilabel>Add Images</"
#| "guilabel> icon in the tool bar or select <menuchoice><guimenu>Import</"
#| "guimenu> <guimenuitem>Add Images...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
#| "menu bar. Select the photographs that you want to add from the file "
#| "dialog and click <guilabel>Open</guilabel>. The photographs will be "
#| "copied into the Album. Additionally, you can use drag and drop to import "
#| "photographs. Drag the photographs icons, for example from a &konqueror; "
#| "window. Then drop it on the image list on the right hand side."
msgid ""
"Most of the time you will create new Albums and populate them with "
"photographs directly from your camera using the Camera Tool. However, "
"sometimes you may want to add a photograph that you already have on your "
"computer to an existing Album. To add a photograph to an Album select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Import</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Add Images...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> (Ctrl+Alt+I) from the menu bar. Select a source "
"folder from the dialog and click OK. An import window will open. Select the "
"photographs that you want to add and choose <guilabel>Download Selected</"
"guilabel> from the <quote>Download</quote> drop down menu. A dialog will "
"open where you can choose the destination album. The photographs will be "
"copied into the Album. <guilabel>Download New</guilabel> (Ctrl+N) from the "
"same menu will copy only those images which are not in the destination "
"folder yet."
msgstr ""
"A maioría das veces vai crear álbums novos e enchelos con fotografías "
"directamente desde a cámara empregando a ferramenta Cámara. Porén, ás veces "
"pode desexar engadir unha fotografía que xa teña no computador a un álbum "
"existente. Para engadir unha fotografía a un álbum, asegúrese de que "
"escolleu Álbum. A seguir, prema a icona <guilabel>Engadir imaxes</guilabel> "
"da barra de ferramentas ou escolla <menuchoice><guimenu>Importar</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Engadir imaxes...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> da barra "
"de menú. Escolla as fotografías que desexe engadir no diálogo de ficheiros e "
"prema <guilabel>Abrir</guilabel>. As fotografías cópianse ao álbum. Ademais "
"disto, tamén pode empregar o arrastrar e soltar para importar fotografías. "
"Arrastre as iconas das fotografías, por exemplo desde unha xanela do "
"&konqueror;. Sólteas sobre a lista de imaxes do lado dereito."

#. Tag: para
#: using-mainwindow.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can use drag and drop to import photographs. Drag the "
"photographs icons, for example from a &dolphin; window. Then drop it on the "
"image list on the right hand side."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-mainwindow.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have a scanner configured, you can also scan a photograph straight "
"into an Album. Select <menuchoice><guimenu>Import</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Import from Scanner...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Se ten un escáner configurado, tamén pode escanear unha fotografía "
"directamente para un álbum. escolla <menuchoice><guimenu>Importar</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Importar dun escáner...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: using-mainwindow.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving or Copying Photographs Between Albums"
msgstr "Mover ou copiar fotografías entre álbums"

#. Tag: para
#: using-mainwindow.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Simply drag the photograph and drop it on the destination Album to move or "
"copy it from one Album to another. A menu will appear that gives you the "
"option to <guilabel>Move</guilabel> or <guilabel>Copy</guilabel> the "
"photograph. You can move or copy multiple photographs the same way, just "
"select all the photographs that you want to move and drag them on to the "
"destination Album."
msgstr ""
"Simplemente arrastre a fotografía e sóltea sobre o álbum de destino para "
"movela ou copiala dun álbum para outro. Aparece un menú que dá a opción de "
"<guilabel>Mover</guilabel> ou <guilabel>Copiar</guilabel> a fotografía. "
"Pódense mover ou copiar varias fotografías da mesma maneira; simplemente "
"escolla todas as fotografías que desexe mover e arrástreas para o álbum de "
"destino."

#. Tag: title
#: using-mainwindow.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid "Managing Albums"
msgstr "Xestión dos álbums"

#. Tag: para
#: using-mainwindow.docbook:345
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "An Album contains a set of photographs. Album Properties allows you to "
