"A <guilabel>Data do álbum</guilabel>: isto emprégase para ordenar os álbums "
"por data empregando <menuchoice><guimenu>Vista</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ordenar "
"os álbums</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Por data</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: using-mainwindow.docbook:370
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Oldest, Average, Newest</guilabel> buttons : these will set the "
"<guilabel>Date</guilabel> to the oldest, average or latest date of the "
"images in that album. It will first try to calculate the average date of the "
